@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {

  usecase "UC-01\nView availability" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\nBook room" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03\nCancel booking" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04\nReceive confirmation" as UC04

  usecase "UC-05\nBlock room" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06\nUnblock room" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07\nReview room usage" as UC07
}

' Student goals
Student --> UC01
Student --> UC02
Student --> UC03
Student --> UC04

' Administrator goals
Administrator --> UC05
Administrator --> UC06
Administrator --> UC07

' A confirmation is required after booking or cancellation
UC02 --> UC04 : <<include>>
UC03 --> UC04 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC02
Assumptions:
- Booking starts in the future (R1)
- Maximum booking duration is 2 hours (R2)
- Same-room bookings cannot overlap (R3)
- A blocked room cannot be booked (R4)
end note

note right of UC04
Confirmation is sent when a
booking or cancellation is recorded.
end note

@enduml
